---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import BrandFish from '@/components/BrandFish.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Bluefish Society — Terminal">
  <main class="screen wano-scroll">
    <section id="identity-screen" class="terminal-view active" aria-label="Entrée terminal">
      <div class="container-terminal">
        <pre class="terminal-box">╔════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
║                                                                    ║
║                      <span class="brand bf-glow">BLUEFISH TERMINAL v1.0</span>                      ║
║                                                                    ║
║                         IDENTIFICATION DOUCE                       ║
║                                                                    ║
╚════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝</pre>

        <pre class="terminal-box">SYSTEM STATUS ......................................... <span class="highlight">[ ONLINE ]</span>
ARCHIVE MODE ..................................... <span class="highlight">NON-COMMERCIAL</span>
ACCESS POLICY .......................................... <span class="highlight">OPEN</span></pre>

        <form id="identity-form" class="prompt">
          <label for="visitor-name">root@bluefish:~$ qui es-tu ? </label>
          <input id="visitor-name" class="terminal-input" name="name" autocomplete="name" placeholder="ton nom" />
          <button class="terminal-submit" type="submit">ENTER</button>
        </form>

        <p class="hint">Aucun compte. Aucun mot de passe. Le nom reste dans ton navigateur.</p>
        <BrandFish class="corner-fish" />
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="manifesto-screen" class="terminal-view" aria-label="Manifesto">
      <div id="manifesto-anchor" class="manifesto-wrap">
        <div id="manifesto-text"></div><span id="manifesto-cursor" class="manifesto-cursor wano-cursor"></span>
        <button id="manifesto-next" class="manifesto-next wano-hint" type="button">[ CLIQUER OU APPUYER SUR UNE TOUCHE POUR CONTINUER ]</button>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="dashboard-screen" class="terminal-view" aria-label="Dashboard">
      <div class="container-terminal">
        <pre class="terminal-box">╔════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
║                       <span class="brand bf-glow">BLUEFISH TERMINAL v1.0</span>                       ║
║                    <span class="highlight">ACCESS GRANTED</span> - CITOYEN <span id="dashboard-name">ANONYME</span>             ║
╚════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝</pre>

        <pre class="terminal-box">┌─ <span class="highlight">SYSTEM INFO</span> ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  USER ..................... <span id="system-name" class="highlight">ANONYME</span>
│  SESSION .................. <span id="session-id">SID-0000-0000</span>
│  UPTIME ................... <span id="uptime">00:00:00</span>
│  DATE ..................... <span id="datetime">LOADING...</span>
└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘</pre>

        <pre class="terminal-box">┌─ <span class="highlight">AVAILABLE MODULES</span> ────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                                                                    │
│  [1] <a href="/tracks">LATEST RELEASE</a> ............ Access newest transmission       │
│  [2] <a href="/tracks">TRACK ARCHIVE</a> ............. Browse complete database         │
│  [3] <a href="#manifesto-anchor" data-replay-manifesto>BLUEFISH CONSTITUTION</a> ... Replay manifesto              │
│  [4] <a href="/mixes/tirage-suspens">SAMPLE MIX PAGE</a> .... Open ASCII artwork shell       │
│                                                                    │
└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘</pre>

        <pre class="terminal-box">┌─ <span class="highlight">SYSTEM LOG</span> ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  <span id="log-1">Initializing open archive...</span>
│  <span id="log-2"></span>
│  <span id="log-3"></span>
└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘</pre>

        <pre class="terminal-box">>> Type 'archive' by clicking TRACK ARCHIVE
>> Type 'clear identity' by clearing local storage in your browser

root@bluefish:~$ <span class="cursor-block wano-cursor"></span></pre>
        <BrandFish class="watermark-fish" />
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <script>
    const manifesto = `BLUEFISH SOCIETY
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

MANIFESTE v1.0


Dans le vide saturé du bruit numérique,
nous traçons des sillons sonores.

Chaque fréquence est un territoire.
Chaque silence, une déclaration.

BLUEFISH n'est pas un label.
BLUEFISH n'est pas une marque.

BLUEFISH est un protocole.
Une infrastructure pour les transmissions non-commerciales.
Un refuge pour les architectures sonores autonomes.

Ici, pas de playlist algorithmique.
Pas de métrique d'engagement.
Pas d'optimisation pour la viralité.

Seulement :
  - Des fichiers audio
  - Des métadonnées minimales
  - Un accès direct

Ce terminal est une porte.
Ce que tu y trouveras dépend de ce que tu cherches.

Bienvenue, citoyen.

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━`;

    const screens = {
      identity: document.getElementById('identity-screen'),
      manifesto: document.getElementById('manifesto-screen'),
      dashboard: document.getElementById('dashboard-screen'),
    };
    const form = document.getElementById('identity-form');
    const input = document.getElementById('visitor-name');
    const manifestoText = document.getElementById('manifesto-text');
    const manifestoCursor = document.getElementById('manifesto-cursor');
    const manifestoNext = document.getElementById('manifesto-next');
    const logEls = ['log-1', 'log-2', 'log-3'].map((id) => document.getElementById(id));
    const logs = ['Loading encrypted manifests...', 'Scanning frequency spectrum...', 'Parsing sonic artifacts...', 'Indexing track metadata...', 'Opening non-commercial channel...'];
    let startedAt = Date.now();
    let logIndex = 0;
    let manifestoTimer;

    function show(key) {
      Object.values(screens).forEach((screen) => screen?.classList.remove('active'));
      screens[key]?.classList.add('active');
    }

    function cleanName(value) {
      return (value || 'ANONYME').trim().slice(0, 24) || 'ANONYME';
    }

    function applyIdentity(name) {
      document.getElementById('dashboard-name').textContent = name.toUpperCase();
      document.getElementById('system-name').textContent = name.toUpperCase();
      document.getElementById('session-id').textContent = `SID-${Math.random().toString(16).slice(2, 6).toUpperCase()}-${Math.random().toString(16).slice(2, 6).toUpperCase()}`;
    }

    function startManifesto() {
      show('manifesto');
      manifestoText.textContent = '';
      manifestoCursor.style.display = 'inline-block';
      manifestoNext.style.display = 'none';
      let index = 0;
      clearTimeout(manifestoTimer);
      const tick = () => {
        index += 3;
        manifestoText.textContent = manifesto.slice(0, index);
        if (index < manifesto.length) manifestoTimer = setTimeout(tick, 12);
        else finishManifesto();
      };
      manifestoTimer = setTimeout(tick, 12);
    }

    function finishManifesto() {
      manifestoText.textContent = manifesto;
      manifestoCursor.style.display = 'none';
      manifestoNext.style.display = 'block';
    }

    function startDashboard() {
      show('dashboard');
      startedAt = Date.now();
      updateClock();
    }

    function updateClock() {
      const now = new Date();
      const elapsed = Math.floor((Date.now() - startedAt) / 1000);
      const uptime = [Math.floor(elapsed / 3600), Math.floor((elapsed % 3600) / 60), elapsed % 60].map((n) => String(n).padStart(2, '0')).join(':');
      document.getElementById('uptime').textContent = uptime;
      document.getElementById('datetime').textContent = `${now.toLocaleDateString('fr-FR')} ${now.toLocaleTimeString('fr-FR')}`;
    }

    function pushLog() {
      logEls[2].textContent = logEls[1].textContent;
      logEls[1].textContent = logEls[0].textContent;
      logEls[0].textContent = logs[logIndex++ % logs.length];
    }

    form?.addEventListener('submit', (event) => {
      event.preventDefault();
      const name = cleanName(input.value);
      localStorage.setItem('bluefish.identity', name);
      applyIdentity(name);
      startManifesto();
    });

    manifestoNext?.addEventListener('click', startDashboard);
    document.addEventListener('keydown', (event) => {
      if (!screens.manifesto.classList.contains('active')) return;
      if (manifestoNext.style.display === 'none') finishManifesto();
      else if (event.key !== 'Tab') startDashboard();
    });

    document.querySelector('[data-replay-manifesto]')?.addEventListener('click', (event) => {
      event.preventDefault();
      startManifesto();
    });

    const existingName = localStorage.getItem('bluefish.identity');
    if (existingName) {
      applyIdentity(cleanName(existingName));
      startDashboard();
    } else {
      setTimeout(() => input?.focus(), 80);
    }

    setInterval(updateClock, 1000);
    setInterval(pushLog, 3200);
  </script>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .terminal-view { display: none; min-height: 100vh; }
  .terminal-view.active { display: block; }

  .prompt {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 0.5ch;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  .terminal-submit {
    border: 1px solid var(--wano-green);
    background: var(--wano-black);
    color: var(--wano-green);
    cursor: pointer;
    padding: 0.25rem 0.6rem;
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-wide);
  }

  .terminal-submit:hover {
    background: var(--wano-green);
    color: var(--wano-black);
  }

  .hint {
    color: var(--wano-grey-400);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  :global(.corner-fish) {
    position: fixed;
    right: 2rem;
    bottom: 1.4rem;
    max-width: 28rem;
    overflow: hidden;
    font-size: 3px;
    opacity: 0.38;
  }

  :global(.watermark-fish) {
    display: block;
    width: fit-content;
    max-width: none;
    margin: 1rem auto 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    font-size: 4px;
    color: var(--wano-green);
    opacity: 0.92;
    pointer-events: none;
    text-shadow: 0 0 7px rgba(31, 243, 224, 0.65);
    transform: translateX(16%);
  }

  .manifesto-wrap {
    min-height: 100vh;
    padding: 3rem 2rem 5rem;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  #manifesto-text {
    max-width: 700px;
    color: var(--wano-white);
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    line-height: var(--leading-relaxed);
    white-space: pre-wrap;
  }

  .manifesto-cursor {
    display: inline-block;
    width: 9px;
    height: 1.1em;
    margin-left: 2px;
    background: var(--wano-green);
    vertical-align: text-bottom;
  }

  .manifesto-next {
    position: fixed;
    bottom: 2rem;
    left: 50%;
    display: none;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    border: 0;
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--wano-green);
    cursor: pointer;
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .cursor-block {
    border-right: 8px solid var(--wano-green);
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    :global(.corner-fish),
    :global(.watermark-fish) { display: none; }
    .manifesto-wrap { padding: 1.5rem 1rem 5rem; }
    #manifesto-text { font-size: var(--text-base); }
  }
</style>
